  "milestones": [
    {
      "date": "2026-05-02",
      "description": "Season 1 (2025-26) archived: journal.html -> journal/season-01.html, season.html -> season/season-01.html, season_log.json -> season_logs/season-01.json. Wrexham AFC finished 1st in the EFL Championship (P46 W36 D4 L6, GF111 GA47, GD+64, 112 pts), automatically promoted. Season 2 begins.",
      "journal_entry": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-02",
      "description": "Arthur Okonkwo picked up a tricep muscle injury (~6 weeks), sidelining him early in Season 2 preparations. Mason Webber (17) is next in line in goal.",
      "journal_entry": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-02",
      "description": "Danny Ward (32, GK) has submitted a transfer request and is unhappy despite dev being complete at OVR 71 — first squad-management decision of Season 2. Both Ward and Arthur Okonkwo flipped from 'not willing' to 'willing to negotiate new terms' in this review; Mason Webber (17) also now willing to negotiate.",
      "journal_entry": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-15",
      "description": "Youth academy roster change — Dijkgraaf and Horne terminated their youth contracts, both wanted out and were not yet good enough for the senior squad. Anton Gassner released from the academy after believing he was good enough for the senior squad — no ultimatums. Added Lenny Kuhn (GK) to the academy."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-05-02",
      "description": "Danny Ward (32, GK) placed on the transfer list by manager decision — Arthur Okonkwo is returning from injury and Mason Webber (17) is being prioritized for development, leaving Ward surplus to the goalkeeping plans."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-23",
      "description": "Aaron James (20, CB/RB, academy prospect) has submitted a transfer request — contract length demands not met and his deal is down to just 1 month remaining. Needs a squad-management decision (renew, extend, or let him go)."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "description": "Squad update — Andres Gomez returns from his broken toe injury. Aaron James will not be offered a new contract and will leave as a free agent when his deal expires. The club will try to sign Issa Kabore permanently when his Man City loan expires, though affordability is uncertain. George Dobson transferred out to Besiktas JK for $2.55m. Signed academy goalkeeper (Germany), initially misreported as Lenny Kuhn, then as Finn Richter — real identity confirmed 2026-07-07 as Leo Bergmann."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-07-23",
      "description": "Signed Chido Obi (18, ST) from the Manchester United academy — a striker prospect, contract accepted with no negotiation friction."
    },
    {
