      "description": "Issa Kabore returned to Manchester City at the end of his loan - the club decided not to pursue a permanent deal. Jay Rodriguez left as a free agent, joining Stade Brestois 29 on the pre-agreed pre-contract move flagged earlier in the summer. Harry Ashfield is back from his Cheltenham Town loan spell. Right-back depth is now thin behind Amelia and A. James."
    },
