    {
      "date": "2026-08-15",
      "description": "Roster change — Cacace made transition to RB. Next article should do a very deep dive, longer than normal piece based on that every move Wrexham have made this year so far has been with one thing in mind - get younger, get more raw talent. They have made serious investments into the young prodigal player from several world football publications, Jenkins is willing to make a gamble that some of these players turn out to be top class. These same publications have raved at how shrewd of a business man Jenkins has proved to be. Nearly every deal has been under market on buys, and he seems to get the most out of every transfer out. New Academy players from scouting in France and Germany: Stephane Bertrand, Jules Collin, Nico Kopp",
      "journal_entry": true
    },
